      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Patients presenting with ischemic chest pain and electrocardiographic evidence of global T-wave inversion are most frequently women with intact left ventricular function and no critical stenosis of major coronary vessels. Hence, this syndrome has a good immediate and long-term prognosis."},
